{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AvA4uLMpLxqEDcYzRXNeq9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Big Buck Hunter Pro x-ray shot heart lung bonus \"kill shot\" pump reload shotgun off screen scoring accuracy\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-22443/\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro\"},{\"title\":\"At a glance\",\"url\":\"https://www.macworld.com/article/1144021/bigbuckhunterreview.html\"},{\"title\":\"At a glance\",\"url\":\"https://www.macworld.com/article/201225/bigbuckhunterreview.html\"},{\"title\":\"servermove.retailgazette.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://servermove.retailgazette.co.uk/?p=17039\"},{\"title\":\"Raw Thrills\",\"url\":\"https://mpamusement.com/collections/video-games/products/big-buck-hunter-pro-arcade-shooting-game\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/wii/big-buck-hunter-pro\"},{\"title\":\"giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro/Images\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro opens its shooting gallery on Xbox for Windows Phone\",\"url\":\"https://windowscentral.com/big-buck-hunter-pro-opens-its-shooting-gallery-windows-phone\"},{\"title\":\"Pro Staff Blog\",\"url\":\"https://huntinglife.com/?p=11942\"},{\"title\":\"LaunchBox Logo Back to Home Page\",\"url\":\"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/165628\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter\",\"url\":\"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Big_Buck_Hunter.html\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Reloaded - Release Change Log\",\"url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fqWR3bvlkIrAa-nVDMO4MPC2EuG-U5Sm9P8Pve_QNMk/mobilebasic\"},{\"title\":\"• Fri. Sep 19th, 2025\",\"url\":\"https://insidearchery.com/?p=26940\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://www.sindenwiki.org/wiki/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro\"},{\"title\":\"buck hunter reloaded\",\"url\":\"https://northamericanhunter.pages.dev/buck_hunter_reloaded\"},{\"title\":\"x ray series big buck\",\"url\":\"https://kencooutfitters.com/products/x-ray-series-big-buck\"},{\"title\":\"X-Ray Series Big Buck\",\"url\":\"https://feathersandantlersoutdoors.com/products/x-ray-series-big-buck\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up anything describing an \"x-ray shot\" or \"kill shot\" bonus in Big Buck Hunter Pro, so I couldn't confirm those mechanics. The results that mention x-rays are about archery targets and deer thermal imaging, not the arcade game. Here's what the results do cover:\n\n- **Heart and lung shots:** A Giant Bomb listing says bucks can be taken down with a head shot, a heart shot, or by peppering them. Bucks can be taken down in a variety of ways; a head shot, heart shot, or just pepper the poor animals! I found no source describing a heart or lung bonus payout.\n- **Scoring for accuracy:** A fan wiki mirror says that a hunter shooting all bonus round items with 100% accuracy will receive Double Bonus worth 2,000 pts. That page appears to describe Big Buck Hunter generally, and it's a low-reliability source.\n- **Critters:** Giant Bomb says critters are a new way of scoring to get extra points on each site. A Raw Thrills product page says players can now shoot these for added bonus points.\n- **Reloading:** A Macworld review of the iPhone port says the reload button is on the bottom of the screen and must be tapped after each shot. A release changelog mentions a \"pump to reload\" speech call in Pro with no pump adjustment, which suggests a pump-reload setting exists.\n- **Off-screen and shot-accuracy issues:** Macworld's review of the iPhone version says when you point a gun in the arcade game, you have a pretty good idea where the shot will land. The reviewer found touchscreen accuracy unreliable. I found no source on off-screen shooting or how it affects scoring.\n\nThe search didn't resolve the x-ray or kill-shot questions. A follow-up search on the Big Buck Hunter Pro arcade manual or scoring guide, or on the Big Buck Hunter Reloaded bonus list, would be the next step.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67077d04-87f0-4158-a4f5-843d0a0e9941","uuid":"b9e97a4a-485f-48ca-8487-4756d89db706","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:53:09.735Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Big Buck Hunter Pro x-ray shot heart lung bonus \"kill shot\" pump reload shotgun off screen scoring accuracy","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_018fve45SvPbw73D4dUhcDLT","content":[{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-22443/"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro"},{"title":"At a glance","url":"https://www.macworld.com/article/1144021/bigbuckhunterreview.html"},{"title":"At a glance","url":"https://www.macworld.com/article/201225/bigbuckhunterreview.html"},{"title":"servermove.retailgazette.co.uk","url":"https://servermove.retailgazette.co.uk/?p=17039"},{"title":"Raw Thrills","url":"https://mpamusement.com/collections/video-games/products/big-buck-hunter-pro-arcade-shooting-game"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/wii/big-buck-hunter-pro"},{"title":"giantbomb.com","url":"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro/Images"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro opens its shooting gallery on Xbox for Windows Phone","url":"https://windowscentral.com/big-buck-hunter-pro-opens-its-shooting-gallery-windows-phone"},{"title":"Pro Staff Blog","url":"https://huntinglife.com/?p=11942"},{"title":"LaunchBox Logo Back to Home Page","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/165628"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter","url":"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Big_Buck_Hunter.html"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Reloaded - Release Change Log","url":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fqWR3bvlkIrAa-nVDMO4MPC2EuG-U5Sm9P8Pve_QNMk/mobilebasic"},{"title":"• Fri. Sep 19th, 2025","url":"https://insidearchery.com/?p=26940"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://www.sindenwiki.org/wiki/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro"},{"title":"buck hunter reloaded","url":"https://northamericanhunter.pages.dev/buck_hunter_reloaded"},{"title":"x ray series big buck","url":"https://kencooutfitters.com/products/x-ray-series-big-buck"},{"title":"X-Ray Series Big Buck","url":"https://feathersandantlersoutdoors.com/products/x-ray-series-big-buck"}]},"The search didn't turn up anything describing an \"x-ray shot\" or \"kill shot\" bonus in Big Buck Hunter Pro, so I couldn't confirm those mechanics. The results that mention x-rays are about archery targets and deer thermal imaging, not the arcade game. Here's what the results do cover:\n\n- **Heart and lung shots:** A Giant Bomb listing says bucks can be taken down with a head shot, a heart shot, or by peppering them. Bucks can be taken down in a variety of ways; a head shot, heart shot, or just pepper the poor animals! I found no source describing a heart or lung bonus payout.\n- **Scoring for accuracy:** A fan wiki mirror says that a hunter shooting all bonus round items with 100% accuracy will receive Double Bonus worth 2,000 pts. That page appears to describe Big Buck Hunter generally, and it's a low-reliability source.\n- **Critters:** Giant Bomb says critters are a new way of scoring to get extra points on each site. A Raw Thrills product page says players can now shoot these for added bonus points.\n- **Reloading:** A Macworld review of the iPhone port says the reload button is on the bottom of the screen and must be tapped after each shot. A release changelog mentions a \"pump to reload\" speech call in Pro with no pump adjustment, which suggests a pump-reload setting exists.\n- **Off-screen and shot-accuracy issues:** Macworld's review of the iPhone version says when you point a gun in the arcade game, you have a pretty good idea where the shot will land. The reviewer found touchscreen accuracy unreliable. I found no source on off-screen shooting or how it affects scoring.\n\nThe search didn't resolve the x-ray or kill-shot questions. A follow-up search on the Big Buck Hunter Pro arcade manual or scoring guide, or on the Big Buck Hunter Reloaded bonus list, would be the next step."],"durationSeconds":7.97053476900002,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AvA4uLMpLxqEDcYzRXNeq9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0153fDvgF4QMvTqre8ugFe87","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\" critters list bonus games \"Mars Needs Cattle\" \"Boars Gone Wild\" trek whitetail elk moose antelope caribou\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-22443/\"},{\"title\":\"www.supercheats.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.supercheats.com/xbox360/bigbuckhunterpro.htm\"},{\"title\":\"At a glance\",\"url\":\"https://www.macworld.com/article/1144021/bigbuckhunterreview.html\"},{\"title\":\"At a glance\",\"url\":\"https://www.macworld.com/article/201225/bigbuckhunterreview.html\"},{\"title\":\"Raw Thrills\",\"url\":\"https://mpamusement.com/collections/video-games/products/big-buck-hunter-pro-arcade-shooting-game\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/wii/big-buck-hunter-pro\"},{\"title\":\"LaunchBox Logo Back to Home Page\",\"url\":\"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/165628\"},{\"title\":\"LaunchBox Logo Back to Home Page\",\"url\":\"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/165628-big-buck-hunter-pro\"},{\"title\":\"giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro/Images\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition\",\"url\":\"https://www.dekudeals.com/items/big-buck-hunter-ultimate-trophy-deluxe-edition?format=digital\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition\",\"url\":\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/big-buck-hunter-big-buck-hunter-ultimate-trophy-deluxe-edition-ec4eec?lang=vi\"},{\"title\":\"www.metacritic.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.metacritic.com/game/big-buck-hunter-pro/details/\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy\",\"url\":\"https://www.xbox.com/mt-MT/games/store/big-buck-hunter-ultimate-trophy/9P7WTQ01JGZ0\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition\",\"url\":\"https://xbox.com/en-ZA/games/store/1/9P8ZNDDCK1K7\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition\",\"url\":\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/big-buck-hunter-big-buck-hunter-ultimate-trophy-deluxe-edition-ec4eec?lang=nl\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition\",\"url\":\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/big-buck-hunter-big-buck-hunter-ultimate-trophy-deluxe-edition-ec4eec?lang=hi\"},{\"title\":\"Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition\",\"url\":\"https://xbox.com/en-IN/games/store/1/9P8ZNDDCK1K7\"},{\"title\":\"ec.nintendo.com\",\"url\":\"https://ec.nintendo.com/apps/0100DC802164A000/US\"}]\n\nThe search found partial matches, but nothing that confirms the full list you asked about (moose, antelope, caribou) or the bonus game names \"Mars Needs Cattle\" and \"Boars Gone Wild.\"\n\n- **Original Pro (2006 arcade):** Big Buck Hunter Pro presents 5 animals available for hunting (6 for online cabinets), 15 bonus rounds (3 extras for online cabinets), and 12 critters to shoot. Adventures are now separated by animal instead of region.\n- **Critter list conflicts across sources:** One listing says critters consist of mountain lions, raccoons, possums, skunks, blackbirds, bluebirds, squirrels, foxes, wolves, and rabbits. MobyGames says twelve in total including squirrel, rabbit, possum and mountain lion. The names don't agree, so I'd check a more detailed source before relying on either.\n- **Bonus games:** One source describes a bonus round that include artificial targets, hunting birds, such as duck and pheasant, frogs, gerbils, boars and there is even a cow abducting UFO round. An achievements list names bonus games including the Pie in the Sky Bonus Game, the Gopher Garden Bonus Game, the Duck Hunt Bonus Game, and the Pappy's Porch Bonus Game. I found no source using the names \"Mars Needs Cattle\" or \"Boars Gone Wild.\"\n- **Ultimate Trophy (newer release):** Dive into 9 animal adventures spanning stunning environments around the world. Explore 27 unique treks that will take you to 135 diverse hunting sites. It also has over 48 small-game critters like Rabbits, Coyotes, and even Crocodiles, and 27 exciting bonus games, like Pappy's Moonshine Factory!\n- **Adventures named in achievements:** Complete the full Whitetail Adventure. and Complete the full Elk Adventure. Moose, antelope, and caribou did not come up in any result.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67077d04-87f0-4158-a4f5-843d0a0e9941","uuid":"16a56faa-f068-4aef-b293-1e0d791b23ea","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:53:10.109Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"Big Buck Hunter Pro\" critters list bonus games \"Mars Needs Cattle\" \"Boars Gone Wild\" trek whitetail elk moose antelope caribou","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EGSuCVyUgjDfBJtNGz6Boq","content":[{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Big_Buck_Hunter_Pro"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-22443/"},{"title":"www.supercheats.com","url":"https://www.supercheats.com/xbox360/bigbuckhunterpro.htm"},{"title":"At a glance","url":"https://www.macworld.com/article/1144021/bigbuckhunterreview.html"},{"title":"At a glance","url":"https://www.macworld.com/article/201225/bigbuckhunterreview.html"},{"title":"Raw Thrills","url":"https://mpamusement.com/collections/video-games/products/big-buck-hunter-pro-arcade-shooting-game"},{"title":"Big Buck Hunter Pro","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/wii/big-buck-hunter-pro"},{"title":"LaunchBox Logo Back to Home Page","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/165628"},{"title":"LaunchBox Logo Back to Home Page","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/165628-big-buck-hunter-pro"},{"title":"giantbomb.com","url":"https://giantbomb