ssum and mountain lion. The names don't agree, so I'd check a more detailed source before relying on either.\n- **Bonus games:** One source describes a bonus round that include artificial targets, hunting birds, such as duck and pheasant, frogs, gerbils, boars and there is even a cow abducting UFO round. An achievements list names bonus games including the Pie in the Sky Bonus Game, the Gopher Garden Bonus Game, the Duck Hunt Bonus Game, and the Pappy's Porch Bonus Game. I found no source using the names \"Mars Needs Cattle\" or \"Boars Gone Wild.\"\n- **Ultimate Trophy (newer release):** Dive into 9 animal adventures spanning stunning environments around the world. Explore 27 unique treks that will take you to 135 diverse hunting sites. It also has over 48 small-game critters like Rabbits, Coyotes, and even Crocodiles, and 27 exciting bonus games, like Pappy's Moonshine Factory!\n- **Adventures named in achievements:** Complete the full Whitetail Adventure. and Complete the full Elk Adventure. Moose, antelope, and caribou did not come up in any result."],"durationSeconds":9.077691155000007,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0153fDvgF4QMvTqre8ugFe87","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
