url\\\":\\\"https://southpolar.netlify.com/game-brigandine-the-legend-of-forsena-iso\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Connect with us\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://well-played.com.au/brigandine-the-legend-of-runersia-review\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Connect with us\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.well-played.com.au/?p=424045\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine The Legend of Runersia – Pc Version – Review\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://turnbasedlovers.com/?p=28403\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine (video game)\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Brigandine_(video_game)\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"www.gamerbraves.com\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.gamerbraves.com/?p=58446\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine The Legend of Runersia – Pc Version – Review\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://turnbasedlovers.com/review/brigandine-the-legend-of-runersia-pc-version-review\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"brigandine the legend of runersia\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.nintendolife.com/reviews/switch-eshop/brigandine_the_legend_of_runersia\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine: The Legend of Runersia\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Brigandine:_The_Legend_of_Runersia\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine (video game)\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/Brigandine_(video_game)\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"brigandine legend runersia review\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://techraptor.Net/gaming/reviews/brigandine-legend-runersia-review\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine: The Legend of Runersia Review\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://rpgamer.com/review/brigandine-the-legend-of-runersia-review/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"brigandine the legend of runersia review of monsters and muddles\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.gameskinny.com/reviews/brigandine-the-legend-of-runersia-review-of-monsters-and-muddles/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine : Abyss modernise le RPG tactique sur grille hexagonale\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.dlcompare.fr/actualites-gaming/brigandine-abyss-ressuscite-le-rpg-tactique-classique-83172\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brigandine: The Legend of Runersia\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/Brigandine%3A_The_Legend_of_Runersia\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"brigandine the legend of runersia review\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://blastawaythegamereview.com/2021/01/18/brigandine-the-legend-of-runersia-review/\\\"}]\\n\\nThe search covered the phase structure well, but it didn't turn up anything on mana or a 12-turn limit.\\n\\n- **Two phases per month or season:** Sources describe the game as split into an Organization phase and an Attack phase. Each month has an organize phase and an attack phase. Another source says that all six nations perform an Organization Phase and an Attack Phase in sequence. These combined actions are called a \\\"season\\\" and mark the passage of time.\\n- **Organization phase:** Players move troops, set their composition, and decide which castles to attack. One source adds that whether to send idle Rune Knights on automated quests for rare items is also decided here. Summoning and reviving monsters is part of this phase too.\\n- **Attack phase:** The turn-based battles make up the Attack Phase. Invasions happen when you can engage in as many invasions during the Attack phase as you feel you can handle.\\n- **Naming:** Forsena is the 1998 PlayStation original (released in North America as The Legend of Forsena), and Runersia is the 2020 sequel with the same core gameplay in a new setting. It is a sequel to the 1998 PlayStation game Brigandine: The Legend of Forsena, and features the same core gameplay with a new setting.\\n\\nNot confirmed by these results: mana mechanics and a 12-turn battle limit. Searching for those specifically, perhaps with \\\"Brigandine battle turn limit\\\", would be the next step if you need them.\\n\\n\\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\