{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017jphQ24iPtw4YSx3Wouji7","type":"tool_result","content":"139:- `E.ctx2d(c)`: a canvas's 2D context with smoothing off (crisp pixels)\n162:- `E.hash2(x, y)`: a fixed random number 0..1 for whole-number grid coordinates (texture specks, scatter that never flickers)\n164:- `E.hsl(hh, s, l)`: '#rrggbb' from hue (degrees), saturation and lightness (0..1)\n170:- `E.mkCanvas(w, h)`: a new canvas of w x h pixels (scratch images and sprite sheets). With no document (Node: a headless game) a stand-in whose drawing does nothing, so sprites and other images made while a game loads don't stop it\n171:- `E.noise2(x, y)`: smooth value noise 0..1 over the plane (one bump per whole unit): blotches, clouds, wobble\n179:- `E.rng(s)`: a seeded random stream: const R = E.rng(42); R() gives 0..1, the same numbers for the same seed (mulberry32)\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0\n496:- `game.script(fn, o)` †: run a coroutine on game time, in the update step: game.script(function* (game) { yield .5; yield E.until(() => door.open); yield game.tween(cam, { y: 0 }, 1); yield E.all([a, b]); ... }, { keep }). Each yield waits: a number (seco\n597:- `E.all(list)` †: a script's wait for every one of its waits (seconds, conditions, tweens, scripts): yield E.all([a, b])\n598:- `E.any(list)` †: a script's wait for the first of its waits to be over: yield E.any([boss.script, 30])\n599:- `E.until(fn)` †: a script's wait until fn() is true: yield E.until(() => door.open)\n603:- `new E.Path(points, o = {}) → path` †: new E.Path(points, { closed: false, smooth: null }): points [x, y, z] (z optional) or { x, y, z } (a side view's height is z); closed runs back to the first; smooth: 'catmull' curves through every point (Catmull-Rom\n1428:- `E.gen.scatter(w, h, o = {})`: Poisson disc points at least o.r (3) apart within w x h, o.k (30) tries each, where o.ok(x, y) allows (Bridson's): [[x, y], ...] in cells, not whole numbers\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174813__x2e02c0/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67077d04-87f0-4158-a4f5-843d0a0e9941","uuid":"faf59676-239a-4803-a149-f54773ec480f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:06:42.021Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"139:- `E.ctx2d(c)`: a canvas's 2D context with smoothing off (crisp pixels)\n162:- `E.hash2(x, y)`: a fixed random number 0..1 for whole-number grid coordinates (texture specks, scatter that never flickers)\n164:- `E.hsl(hh, s, l)`: '#rrggbb' from hue (degrees), saturation and lightness (0..1)\n170:- `E.mkCanvas(w, h)`: a new canvas of w x h pixels (scratch images and sprite sheets). With no document (Node: a headless game) a stand-in whose drawing does nothing, so sprites and other images made while a game loads don't stop it\n171:- `E.noise2(x, y)`: smooth value noise 0..1 over the plane (one bump per whole unit): blotches, clouds, wobble\n179:- `E.rng(s)`: a seeded random stream: const R = E.rng(42); R() gives 0..1, the same numbers for the same seed (mulberry32)\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0\n496:- `game.script(fn, o)` †: run a coroutine on game time, in the update step: game.script(function* (game) { yield .5; yield E.until(() => door.open); yield game.tween(cam, { y: 0 }, 1); yield E.all([a, b]); ... }, { keep }). Each yield waits: a number (seco\n597:- `E.all(list)` †: a script's wait for every one of its waits (seconds, conditions, tweens, scripts): yield E.all([a, b])\n598:- `E.any(list)` †: a script's wait for the first of its waits to be over: yield E.any([boss.script, 30])\n599:- `E.until(fn)` †: a script's wait until fn() is true: yield E.until(() => door.open)\n603:- `new E.Path(points, o = {}) → path` †: new E.Path(points, { closed: false, smooth: null }): points [x, y, z] (z optional) or { x, y, z } (a side view's height is z); closed runs back to the first; smooth: 'catmull' curves through every point (Catmull-Rom\n1428:- `E.gen.scatter(w, h, o = {})`: Poisson disc points at least o.r (3) apart within w x h, o.k (30) tries each, where o.ok(x, y) allows (Bridson's): [[x, y], ...] in cells, not whole numbers","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174813__x2e02c0/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":902,"oldLines":3,"newStart":902,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":27300,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"e022d9b7-586e-4d73-ba07-4e50e7de9b00\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":27400,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"a1a85458-3e89-4829-87c5-ef5443fcf753\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":27550,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"1dbff920-9d2e-4feb-adbc-79d798a36185\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":27650,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"5a41ae19-5518-4a0d-9e76-88983ad8374d\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174743__x8534