{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Mm4QfTRaafcQnTaVrWoov","type":"tool_result","content":"795:- **Trophy Cam** (trophy kills, and in single player the last buck of a site if it was a heart shot; setting On /\n- **Trophy Cam** (trophy kills, and in single player the last buck of a site if it was a heart shot; setting On /\n  Trophies only / Off): 1.4 s of slow motion (`game.timeScale = 0.15`; the sim slows, not the cam): the lens flies\n  from the vantage along the shot's ray to 3 m from the impact, the fov narrows, a bullet streak leads; at impact the\n  animal flashes to its x-ray look (skeleton, heart and lungs) for 0.35 s; normal speed for its collapse; back to the\n  vantage with a fade. Skippable (confirm). Never during local multiplayer or hub rounds (they show the Shot Chart\n  only). Under Reduce motion it is a still x-ray card.\n- Skunk: a green dithered cloud over 60% of the screen fading over 3 s, a \"pfft\" and a stink chord.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67077d04-87f0-4158-a4f5-843d0a0e9941","uuid":"49148565-9202-4500-a851-3aad25f2c8be","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:24:56.877Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"795:- **Trophy Cam** (trophy kills, and in single player the last buck of a site if it was a heart shot; setting On /\n- **Trophy Cam** (trophy kills, and in single player the last buck of a site if it was a heart shot; setting On /\n  Trophies only / Off): 1.4 s of slow motion (`game.timeScale = 0.15`; the sim slows, not the cam): the lens flies\n  from the vantage along the shot's ray to 3 m from the impact, the fov narrows, a bullet streak leads; at impact the\n  animal flashes to its x-ray look (skeleton, heart and lungs) for 0.35 s; normal speed for its collapse; back to the\n  vantage with a fade. Skippable (confirm). Never during local multiplayer or hub rounds (they show the Shot Chart\n  only). Under Reduce motion it is a still x-ray card.\n- Skunk: a green dithered cloud over 60% of the screen fading over 3 s, a \"pfft\" and a stink chord.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":1865,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1865,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":81750,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714\",\"uuid\":\"9d1e5020-df58-4b5b-bc8c-6656ff740b50\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":81850,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714\",\"uuid\":\"5dc0a4eb-d673-4c4f-95cd-c81f9eb55bb7\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":81950,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714\",\"uuid\":\"05b0c338-cb05-4c75-a2b8-039aaecf1f19\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":82050,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714\",\"uuid\":\"e9d60cbe-45cf-49ac-9d6e-ec13df09b6d9\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174816__xe73303/work/PLAN.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1014,"oldLines":7,"newStart":1014,"newLines":7,"lines":["    commentary line), the objectives ticking ★, then CONTINUE / REMATCH / MAIN MENU."," 10. **Records**: big numbers with a label each: Hardest Shot (km/h = u/s ÷ 16 × 3.6), Biggest Hit, Most Goals in a","     Game, Fights Won, KABOOMs, Story Stars x/15, Drills x/7. Two pages at most.","-11. **About**: section 7.20's pages, paged with L1/R1, left/right or a click on the arrows.","+11. **About**: section 12.1's pages, paged with L1/R1, left/right or a click on the arrows."," 12. **Credits**: the end roll over highlight replays."," "," ### 12.1 About / Credits screen"]}]