",\n \"There are no pickups or power-ups in play; the player's kit and the goals are:\"),\n(\"5. **Scope and breath**: a 150 m target: hold [L2], hold [R1], squeeze.\",\n \"5. **Scope and breath**: a 150 m target: hold the scope, hold breath, fire (each named by its glyph).\"),\n]\nfor a, b in reps:\n    assert s.count(a) == 1, a[:60]\n    s = s.replace(a, b)\nopen(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF","description":"Drop an unconfirmed source claim and fix a hard-coded glyph"}}}
