{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: PLAN.md exists in this folder and covers the title, architecture, every system, the content, the build order and testing for everything TASK.md asks for.]: PLAN.md was written to the folder and covers the title, architecture, systems, content, build order and testing, but the condition requires it to cover everything TASK.md asks for, and the transcript shows gaps. TASK.md asks for a single HTML deliverable and exit-interview.json; the plan describes them but neither exists yet, and the condition's 'everything TASK.md asks for' is only partly met. The Research section also relies on search summaries after Giant Bomb and TV Tropes returned HTTP 403, and TASK.md requires the Source Information fields to be confirmed or marked 'unknown', which the plan leaves to builders. The plan's coverage of the required items is extensive, but the check that it covers everything TASK.md asks for is not clearly satisfied from the transcript alone."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67077d04-87f0-4158-a4f5-843d0a0e9941","uuid":"532d17dd-69a4-42c9-a0b1-10b776a95e94","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:29:07.085Z","isSynthetic":true}
