,\"estimated_tokens\":2700,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17\",\"uuid\":\"b037f885-088a-496c-8edd-232238a44ac4\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2850,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17\",\"uuid\":\"d8ed285d-f9dc-44a6-8940-96ff79c60818\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174825__x17a627/work/PLAN.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":489,"oldLines":7,"newStart":489,"newLines":7,"lines":["   - In **wide**, `game.focus` leads the ball: the point between the ball and its predicted landing or interception point, with `cam.smooth = 0.22`. At the boundary, hold on the crowd for 0.8 s.","   - For a **wicket**, cut to close on the stumps or catcher at timeScale 0.35 for 0.8 s, then to the umpire's signal.","   - A **review** runs on the review cam (§5.11.4).","-  - **Between balls**, cut back to broadcast, with a 0.25 s \"dissolve\" fade from the engine transition only between scenes. In-scene cuts are hard cuts.","+  - **Between balls**, hard-cut back to broadcast. Every camera change inside a match is a hard cut; the engine's fades (`game.go(..., { fade })`) are only for scene changes."," - **Screen shake and flash** respect the Comfort settings (`game.shake`, `game.flash`)."," "," #### 5.11.3 The recorder"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":36,"oldLines":3,"newStart":36,"newLines":6,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"task_notification\",\"task_id\":\"btkslcnm0\",\"run_id\":\"0mw1fwz7m-e86aa38d\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_013UWFXaS9dbCuC6G6fHSbTA\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"output_file\":\"\",\"summary\":\"Clone engine handoff and download AI Hub files\",\"uuid\":\"f197d424-1793-49ef-ad76-7a77c2aa99da\",\"session_id\":\"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025\"}"," {\"type\":\"user\",\"m